  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD supports Caritas Africa with core costs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Approval #1 of this project had been to contribute to the capacity strengthening of the Southern Africa Caritas Member Organisations and meet the needs of MOs in terms of professional standards and competencies in order to enable them to fully carry out their socio-pastoral mission by supporting a capacity strengthening officer and the development of new regional capacity strengthening initiatives.
Approval #2 of this project is to support an Advocacy and Policy Officer and a Resource Mobilization post.
Approval #4 includes an amount to support the recruitment and salary of a Humanitarian Officer for one year (June 2022 - May 2023) and for continued support for Advocacy Officer and Resource Mobilization Officer.
Approval #5 continues support for core costs, humanitarian advocacy programme officer, Resource Mobilization officer. #6 supports Caritas Africa&apos;s Organisational Plan.
Approval #7 Support towards caritas Africa operational plan
Approval # 8 Additional grant
Approval#9 Support towards caritas Africa operational plan</narrative>
  </description>
